[Date]

[Name of agency — e.g., Social Security Administration]
[Office address or “Local SSA Office”]

Subject: Request for copy of Social Security card / official SSN verification

Dear Sir or Madam,

I am writing to request a copy of my Social Security card (or an official SSN verification letter) for [brief reason, e.g., employment verification, benefits application]. My details are:

- Full legal name: [Your full name]  
- Date of birth: [MM/DD/YYYY]  
- SSN: last four digits 3456  
- Current address: [Your address]

I have enclosed copies of the required identification documents: [e.g., U.S. passport / state driver’s license / state ID]. Please let me know if you need any additional documentation or forms.

Preferred delivery method: [mail to my address / hold for pickup at local office / other]

You can reach me at [phone number] or [email address] if you need further information. Thank you for your assistance.

